sections.usage:
```
Generate a Remotion video script for [PRODUCT_NAME] that includes: 1) A 15-second hook highlighting the product's core value, 2) A 30-second feature demonstration with on-screen annotations, 3) A 20-second testimonial from a satisfied customer, and 4) A 10-second call-to-action with pricing and purchase link. Use [BRAND_TONE] tone (professional, energetic, or friendly). Structure the script in Remotion's JSON format with timing and visual cues. Include [PLACEHOLDERS] for customization.
```
Copy

```
```json
{
  "title": "Motion Bearings: Smooth Operations for Your Machinery",
  "duration": 75,
  "frames": [
    {
      "time": 0,
      "duration": 15,
      "element": "video",
      "src": "https://motion.com/hero.mp4",
      "overlay": {
        "text": "Bearings that keep your machinery running 24/7",
        "style": {"color": "#ffffff", "fontSize": 48, "fontWeight": "bold"}
      }
    },
    {
      "time": 15,
      "duration": 30,
      "element": "video",
      "src": "https://motion.com/bearing-demo.mp4",
      "annotations": [
        {
          "time": 20,
          "text": "Self-lubricating",
          "position": "top-left",
          "style": {"color": "#00ff00"}
        },
        {
          "time": 35,
          "text": "High load capacity",
          "position": "bottom-right",
          "style": {"color": "#00ff00"}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "time": 45,
      "duration": 20,
      "element": "video",
      "src": "https://motion.com/testimonial.mp4",
      "overlay": {
        "text": "Reduced downtime by 40% in our factory",
        "style": {"color": "#ffffff", "fontSize": 36}
      }
    },
    {
      "time": 65,
      "duration": 10,
      "element": "video",
      "src": "https://motion.com/cta.mp4",
      "overlay": {
        "text": "Starting at $12.99 | Order now: motion.com/bearings",
        "style": {"color": "#ffffff", "fontSize": 32}
      }
    }
  ]
}
```
```

